ets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","AWS IoT Core","El conector de Lamassu para AWS IoT Core sincroniza las identidades de los dispositivos con la plataforma AWS, gestionando el registro de CAs, el aprovisionamiento de Things y el ciclo de vida de los certificados de forma automática y orientada a eventos.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core",{"_81":322},"platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core.mdx","es:platform/iot-fleets/integrations",{"_210":325},"platform/iot-fleets/integrations/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg>","es:platform/iot-fleets",{"_210":329},"platform/iot-fleets/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg>",{"_57":332,"_64":74,"_59":221,"_68":333,"_77":-7,"_12":334,"_79":335},"es:platform/iot-fleets/overview.mdx","Organiza los dispositivos y sus identidades, prepara el enrolamiento e integra consumidores.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/overview",{"_81":336},"platform/iot-fleets/overview.mdx",{"_64":65,"_59":338,"_